  "How it's told": "讲述方式",
  "Your cast speak their lines on camera, shot by shot — a real little film.": "你的演员在镜头前逐个镜头说出台词——一部真正的小电影。",
  "a few minutes a shot": "每个镜头约几分钟",
  "A storyteller's voice over a picture for every scene, with the words on screen — the story format feeds are full of.": "每个场景一幅画面，配上讲故事的旁白，文字同步显示在屏幕上——正是信息流里随处可见的故事形式。",
  "ready in a couple of minutes": "几分钟即可完成",
  "Each scene is one picture and two or three spoken sentences — about ten seconds. A slow, spooky narrator takes a little longer.": "每个场景是一幅画面加两三句旁白——约十秒。语速缓慢、阴森的旁白会稍长一些。",
  "Each shot is one spoken line on camera, up to about ten seconds. More shots, longer film — and a longer render.": "每个镜头是一句对着镜头说的台词，最长约十秒。镜头越多，影片越长——渲染也越久。",
  "What shape?": "选哪种画幅？",
  "Wide for YouTube and TV; Vertical for Shorts, Reels and TikTok; Square for a feed.": "宽幅适合 YouTube 和电视；竖屏适合 Shorts、Reels 和 TikTok；方形适合信息流。",
  "Words on screen": "屏幕文字",
  "Most people watch with the sound off — captions keep them watching. They say exactly what you wrote, in time with the voice.": "大多数人都是静音观看——字幕能让他们继续看下去。字幕与你写的内容一字不差，并与声音同步。",
  "Put the spoken lines on screen — exactly as you wrote them, in time with each voice.": "把台词显示在屏幕上——与你写的一字不差，并与每个声音同步。",
  "the door opened": "门开了",
  "The door opened before his hand came down.": "他的手还没落下，门就开了。",
  "Who tells it?": "由谁来讲？",
  "Tap a voice to pick it, the play button to hear it. A character voice is performed — a hollow whisper for a ghost story, a giggle for a bedtime one.": "点击声音即可选用，点击播放按钮可试听。角色声音是演出来的——讲鬼故事用空洞的低语，讲睡前故事带着咯咯的笑声。",
