  "Same film, a different AI behind the lens. Each one is tagged in your Archive, so you can run both and compare.": "同一部影片，换一个 AI 来掌镜。每个版本在你的存档中都有标记，你可以两个都跑一遍来比较。",
  "Render engine": "渲染引擎",
  "Long single takes with natural lip-sync. What we recommend.": "一气呵成的长镜头，口型自然。我们的推荐。",
  "recommended": "推荐",
  "Short, glossy, cinematic beats.": "短小精致、富有电影感的片段。",
  "Your story": "你的故事",
  "We write the story and draw a picture for every scene. Read it, change any line, re-draw any picture — nothing is spent until you Generate.": "我们来写故事，并为每个场景画一幅画面。读一读，任何一句都能改，任何一幅都能重画——在你点击“生成”之前不会有任何消耗。",
  "Estimated spoken length of the whole film": "整部影片的预计台词时长",
  "film": "影片",
  "We'll write the dialogue — then edit it like a text thread: tweak lines, swap who talks, add a scene. No tokens until you Generate.": "我们来写对白——然后你可以像编辑聊天记录一样修改：调整台词、换说话的人、添加场景。在你点击“生成”之前不消耗代币。",
